            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesDefeated = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemiesDefeated &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" enemiesDefeated++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemiesDefeated);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>0</code> do <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lives = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (lives &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" lives++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lives);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146818,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt;= \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" level++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(level);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146819,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" frames = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (frames &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(frames);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" frames++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liczby od <code>0</code> do <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>0</code> do <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby od <code>0</code> do <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl w konsoli liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>4</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score += 2;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>score++;</code>, a następnie <code>console.log(score);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146821,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak nazywa się zmienna licznika w tym kodzie?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Top scores:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rank = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; rank &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; rank++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(rank + \" /><text value=\"&quot;.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>rank</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Top scores:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>rank</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146822,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Złóż pętlę for, aby wyświetlała w konsoli liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>4</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &gt; 5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &lt; 4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i &lt; 5</code>, a następnie <code>console.log(i)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy spawned!</code> trzy razy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>0</code> do <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Enemy spawned!</code> trzy razy.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W nawiasach zwiększ wartość zmiennej licznika za pomocą operatora <code>++</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"68\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level map:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" row = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" row += \" /><text value=\"&quot;#&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(row);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która zmienna jest zmienną licznika pętli for?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Coins:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" line += i;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(line);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>label</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" timer = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; timer &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; timer--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(timer);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Liczby rosnące od <code>0</code> do <code>5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby odliczane od <code>5</code> do <code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"true\">Liczby odliczane od <code>5</code> do <code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby odliczane od <code>5</code> do <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Czy kod wewnątrz pętli się wykonuje?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hp = \" /><text value=\"-10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; hp &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; hp++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Nie możemy stwierdzić, czy kod wewnątrz pętli jest wykonywany</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Nie, ponieważ gdy pętla się rozpoczyna, wartość zmiennej licznika jest mniejsza niż <code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kod działa</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nie, ponieważ gdy pętla się rozpoczyna, wartość zmiennej licznika jest mniejsza niż <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zakoduj warunek, w którym pętla działa do momentu, aż zmienna licznika osiągnie wartość <code>5</code>, ale nie wyświetla <code>5</code> w konsoli.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>; i &gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zakoduj iterator tak, aby zmienna licznika zmniejszała się za każdym powtórzeniem pętli.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ammo++\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ammo += 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; ammo &gt; \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; ammo--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>ammo--</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zakoduj warunek tak, aby zmienna licznika odliczała od <code>5</code> do <code>1</code>. Uwzględnij liczbę <code>1</code> w warunku.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i</code>, następnie <code>&gt;=</code> i na końcu <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
